# @livekit/local-inference's win32-x64-msvc native binary crashes with a
# Windows access violation (0xC0000005) when the voice-agent worker actually
# loads it in its isolated inference subprocess, on this machine. It's a
# purely optional local speed optimization for VAD/EOT — the framework's own
# code already falls back cleanly to cloud-based turn detection when it's
# absent, which is the known-working state this flag preserves.
omit=optional
